WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.100
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.370 --> 01:34.930
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.229 --> 01:37.650
[Episode 47]

4
01:39.140 --> 01:41.259
Yun Guichuan, you must think carefully.

5
01:39.310 --> 01:44.050
[Temporary Headquarters of the Red 4th Regiment, Lazikou, Gansu]

6
01:41.920 --> 01:43.280
Your success or failure

7
01:43.520 --> 01:44.600
determines whether our Red 4th Regiment

8
01:44.600 --> 01:46.310
can break through the natural barrier of Lazikou,

9
01:46.310 --> 01:47.990
and whether Chairman Mao and the CPC Central Committee

10
01:47.990 --> 01:49.190
can pass through smoothly.

11
01:49.190 --> 01:50.120
Report, leader.

12
01:50.240 --> 01:52.110
Chairman Mao's business can't be delayed even more.

13
01:52.110 --> 01:53.150
I can climb up.

14
02:00.960 --> 02:02.220
If you really succeed,

15
02:02.280 --> 02:04.440
I will definitely celebrate your success.

16
02:04.440 --> 02:05.390
Okay.

17
02:05.800 --> 02:06.520
Zhenhua.

18
02:07.110 --> 02:07.720
Here.

19
02:07.860 --> 02:09.410
We will report to the Army and Division leaders.

20
02:09.410 --> 02:11.340
You go back and prepare for action.

21
02:11.400 --> 02:12.160
Yes.

22
02:16.320 --> 02:17.150
Go.

23
02:21.110 --> 02:22.520
You have to do your best.

24
02:22.800 --> 02:24.520
Just like the capture of Luding Bridge,

25
02:24.520 --> 02:26.120
win some merit and show them.

26
02:26.270 --> 02:27.360
Company Commander.

27
02:27.360 --> 02:28.800
As for merit, during the capture of Luding Bridge,

28
02:28.800 --> 02:29.730
I already won it.

29
02:29.870 --> 02:30.920
It's nothing new.

30
02:31.150 --> 02:32.150
This time,

31
02:33.800 --> 02:35.660
can you give me your small pistol?

32
02:38.670 --> 02:40.590
Wait until you catch an officer

33
02:40.590 --> 02:42.660
higher than the Division Chief of Staff.

34
02:42.660 --> 02:49.500
[Frontline Headquarters of the Red 1st Army]

35
02:43.110 --> 02:44.079
Our battle plan

36
02:44.520 --> 02:46.200
is for the Second Battalion to launch a frontal attack,

37
02:46.200 --> 02:48.200
with the Sixth Company acting as a commando team

38
02:48.200 --> 02:50.079
to pin down and draw the enemy's fire.

39
02:50.079 --> 02:52.480
Meanwhile, two companies from the First Battalion and the Reconnaissance Company

40
02:52.480 --> 02:53.920
will form an outflanking force.

41
02:53.920 --> 02:55.870
They will climb the cliff on the right side of Lazikou,

42
02:55.870 --> 02:57.710
hide on the mountain behind the enemy,

43
02:57.710 --> 02:59.640
and launch a surprise attack from above.

44
02:59.640 --> 03:00.770
Climbing the cliff?

45
03:01.920 --> 03:02.760
Are you sure about this?

46
03:02.760 --> 03:03.590
One of our young soldiers

47
03:03.590 --> 03:04.880
practiced it before dark.

48
03:04.880 --> 03:05.880
No problem.

49
03:08.670 --> 03:10.150
Who will lead the frontal attack?

50
03:10.150 --> 03:11.240
And who will lead the outflanking force?

51
03:11.240 --> 03:12.300
Reporting to the leader.

52
03:12.300 --> 03:14.270
Comrade Yang Chengwu is in charge of the frontal attack,

53
03:14.270 --> 03:16.400
and I will lead the outflanking force.

54
03:17.110 --> 03:17.990
Good.

55
03:18.320 --> 03:19.550
I will emphasize this again.

56
03:19.550 --> 03:21.710
This battle can only be won, not lost.

57
03:21.710 --> 03:23.200
Please rest assured, leader.

58
03:23.200 --> 03:24.440
If we can't take Lazikou,

59
03:24.440 --> 03:26.670
I, Huang Kaixiang, will bring you my head.

60
03:26.670 --> 03:27.930
I don't need your head.

61
03:29.680 --> 03:31.750
I want Lazikou before dawn.

62
03:32.030 --> 03:32.500
Yes, sir!

63
03:32.500 --> 03:33.060
Yes, sir!

64
03:57.200 --> 03:58.079
Bugler!

65
03:58.290 --> 03:59.050
Here!

66
03:59.470 --> 04:00.050
Sound the bugle!

67
04:00.050 --> 04:00.680
Yes, sir!

68
04:03.880 --> 04:05.000
Charge!

69
04:05.590 --> 04:06.710
Charge!

70
04:18.329 --> 04:19.160
Yun Guichuan,

71
04:20.269 --> 04:21.120
are you ready?

72
04:21.519 --> 04:22.230
Ready.

73
04:23.990 --> 04:25.360
It's up to you now. Go!

74
04:25.390 --> 04:26.100
Yes, sir!

75
04:32.260 --> 04:33.260
On guard.

76
04:37.970 --> 04:39.340
Come on, go.

77
06:50.370 --> 06:51.580
Everyone!

78
06:52.050 --> 06:54.380
Stop risking your lives for the warlords!

79
06:54.550 --> 06:55.810
Lay down your weapons!

80
06:56.050 --> 06:57.450
Let's have a chat!

81
06:58.390 --> 07:00.150
The Red Army treats captives well.

82
07:00.150 --> 07:01.760
You are welcome to join us!

83
07:26.470 --> 07:27.970
Yun Guichuan!

84
07:41.500 --> 07:42.700
Regiment Commander.

85
07:43.000 --> 07:45.040
Comrades, charge!

86
07:53.470 --> 07:54.310
It's done.

87
09:26.630 --> 09:29.110
Political Commissar, it's almost dawn.

88
09:29.630 --> 09:31.630
I'll lead the 6th Company to charge!

89
09:38.060 --> 09:38.910
Prepare to charge!

90
09:38.910 --> 09:39.670
Yes, sir!

91
09:40.200 --> 09:42.290
6th Company, prepare to charge!

92
09:54.730 --> 09:55.490
Throw!

93
10:27.990 --> 10:30.160
Comrades, kill!

94
10:30.350 --> 10:32.070
Kill!

95
10:55.340 --> 10:56.600
Report, Chairman Mao.

96
10:56.740 --> 10:58.650
After more than two hours of fierce fighting,

97
10:58.650 --> 11:01.260
[Zuo Quan, Chief of Staff of the 1st Red Army Corps]

98
10:59.200 --> 11:00.280
the 4th Regiment

99
11:00.560 --> 11:01.710
broke through Lazikou early this morning!

100
11:01.710 --> 11:03.670
Good, good!

101
11:05.000 --> 11:06.960
Huang Kaixiang, the 'Axe General,' clears the way through mountains,

102
11:06.960 --> 11:10.090
and Yang Chengwu, with his steel gun, wins every battle.

103
11:10.360 --> 11:12.390
The 4th Regiment has made another contribution to the Red Army.

104
11:12.390 --> 11:14.330
Zuo Quan, notify the 4th Regiment immediately.

105
11:14.330 --> 11:14.990
Do not stop.

106
11:15.320 --> 11:16.600
Continue to advance and wipe out the enemy.

107
11:16.600 --> 11:18.330
Your entire army must not stop.

108
11:18.440 --> 11:19.260
Push forward in one vigorous effort

109
11:19.260 --> 11:20.620
and break into southern Gansu!

110
11:20.620 --> 11:21.220
Yes!

111
11:33.060 --> 11:35.610
A path to survival has finally been opened!

112
11:41.170 --> 11:44.360
Early in the morning, September 17, 1935,

113
11:45.140 --> 11:47.400
after a fierce battle, the 4th Red Regiment

114
11:47.400 --> 11:50.000
broke through the natural barrier of Lazikou.

115
11:50.550 --> 11:53.730
This battle completely shattered

116
11:53.760 --> 11:56.230
Chiang Kai-shek's plot to use the natural barrier

117
11:56.230 --> 11:57.800
to trap the Central Red Army

118
11:57.800 --> 11:59.930
in the snow mountains and grasslands,

119
12:00.160 --> 12:02.490
opening up a passage into southern Gansu.

120
12:03.020 --> 12:04.420
Once Lazikou was opened,

121
12:05.130 --> 12:07.030
the whole game came alive.

122
12:14.350 --> 12:17.240
[Min County, Gansu]

123
12:58.460 --> 13:00.350
After breaking through the natural barrier of Lazikou,

124
13:00.350 --> 13:02.580
the 4th Red Regiment broke through multiple enemy defense lines

125
13:02.580 --> 13:04.630
and occupied Dacaotan that evening.

126
13:04.630 --> 13:05.800
That was the Kuomintang army's

127
13:05.800 --> 13:08.230
supply base for the 1st Brigade, New 14th Division.

128
13:08.230 --> 13:10.230
We captured hundreds of thousands of catties of grain

129
13:10.230 --> 13:12.360
and over two thousand catties of salt.

130
13:12.680 --> 13:14.540
Where is the 4th Red Regiment now?

131
13:14.630 --> 13:15.630
They didn't stop.

132
13:15.920 --> 13:17.750
The Reconnaissance Company occupied the east gate of Minzhou.

133
13:17.750 --> 13:19.110
The main force of the regiment continued eastward

134
13:19.110 --> 13:20.970
and has already occupied Hadapu.

135
13:21.110 --> 13:23.280
This is truly an unstoppable force.

136
13:23.330 --> 13:24.240
Yes.

137
13:24.270 --> 13:25.200
I'm thinking

138
13:25.630 --> 13:26.630
we should still have

139
13:26.630 --> 13:27.080
Peng (Peng Dehuai), Li (Li Fuchun),

140
13:27.080 --> 13:27.710
Lin (Lin Biao), and Nie (Nie Rongzhen)

141
13:27.710 --> 13:28.990
send a telegram in their names

142
13:28.990 --> 13:30.710
to Zhu (Zhu De), Zhang (Zhang Guotao),

143
13:30.710 --> 13:31.590
Xu (Xu Xiangqian), and Chen (Chen Changhao),

144
13:31.590 --> 13:33.750
and even the commanders of the Left Route Army.

145
13:33.750 --> 13:34.950
We'll send a telegram

146
13:35.110 --> 13:35.950
to tell them

147
13:36.560 --> 13:37.870
that for the past three and a half months,

148
13:37.870 --> 13:41.280
our difficult situation deep in the Tibetan area has changed.

149
13:41.280 --> 13:42.940
Materials are abundant here.

150
13:43.060 --> 13:44.280
Supplies are sufficient.

151
13:44.280 --> 13:46.050
The masses strongly support the Red Army.

152
13:46.050 --> 13:48.180
We ask them to march north immediately

153
13:48.230 --> 13:50.870
and strive to join forces with us as soon as possible.

154
13:50.870 --> 13:52.240
-Yeah. -I totally agree.

155
13:52.240 --> 13:54.510
Then we will rest in Hadapu

156
13:54.870 --> 13:57.000
while waiting for them to march north!

157
13:57.190 --> 13:57.710
Okay.

158
13:57.740 --> 13:58.700
Good, good.

159
14:23.950 --> 14:25.950
Chairman, what are you smiling at?

160
14:27.440 --> 14:28.840
I see farmland.

161
14:29.840 --> 14:31.240
I see iron plows.

162
14:31.750 --> 14:34.280
This means we have left the pastoral area

163
14:34.350 --> 14:36.540
and returned to the farming area.

164
14:36.930 --> 14:38.890
Chiang Kai-shek's plot to trap us

165
14:38.920 --> 14:41.350
in the bitter cold of northwestern Sichuan

166
14:41.590 --> 14:42.870
has failed again!

167
14:51.210 --> 14:52.270
Fellow villagers.

168
14:52.680 --> 14:53.510
May I ask,

169
14:53.830 --> 14:55.590
where are you going?

170
14:55.990 --> 14:56.830
Where?

171
14:56.950 --> 14:57.700
What?

172
14:58.030 --> 14:59.860
Where are you going?

173
15:00.160 --> 15:01.760
We are going to dig potatoes.

174
15:02.070 --> 15:02.950
Raise fish?

175
15:02.990 --> 15:03.320
Potatoes.

176
15:03.320 --> 15:03.730
Raise fish?

177
15:03.730 --> 15:05.590
Potatoes. The potatoes you boil.

178
15:06.800 --> 15:07.660
It's potatoes.

179
15:09.510 --> 15:10.560
When you speak,

180
15:10.680 --> 15:11.660
I don't quite understand.

181
15:11.660 --> 15:13.670
And you don't quite understand me either.

182
15:13.670 --> 15:16.000
After you finish planting these potatoes

183
15:16.120 --> 15:16.950
and harvest them,

184
15:16.950 --> 15:18.920
what will you plant after turning the soil?

185
15:18.920 --> 15:20.630
Flax, soybeans.

186
15:21.550 --> 15:22.150
And...

187
15:22.170 --> 15:22.810
Soybeans?

188
15:22.860 --> 15:23.520
Fenugreek.

189
15:24.470 --> 15:25.080
Fu beans?

190
15:25.110 --> 15:26.400
Make steamed buns with Fenugreek...

191
15:26.400 --> 15:26.750
Fenugreek?

192
15:26.750 --> 15:27.750
It tastes so good.

193
15:27.800 --> 15:28.710
Fenugreek.

194
15:28.870 --> 15:30.800
F-fenugreek.

195
15:31.350 --> 15:32.230
Okay.

196
15:32.460 --> 15:34.190
It makes the buns taste so good.

197
15:37.110 --> 15:38.350
We're leaving now.

198
15:38.920 --> 15:39.960
Okay, goodbye.

199
15:39.960 --> 15:41.360
They are all very polite.

200
15:41.440 --> 15:46.560
Ma Wu, my dear, what a kind heart you have!

201
15:47.040 --> 15:51.680
You wrap rock sugar in a patchwork hand towel.

202
15:51.680 --> 15:52.830
What tune is this?

203
15:53.870 --> 15:55.440
It's high-pitched and rough,

204
15:55.440 --> 15:57.400
yet melodious.

205
15:57.860 --> 15:59.570
It seems different from

206
16:00.160 --> 16:01.560
what we've heard before.

207
16:01.990 --> 16:03.950
When I was in Xuanwo Village yesterday,

208
16:03.950 --> 16:05.560
I heard the landlord sing it too.

209
16:05.560 --> 16:07.710
He said it's called Hua'er,

210
16:08.280 --> 16:11.280
a kind of folk songs fellow villagers all like to sing.

211
16:11.560 --> 16:12.590
Such a tune

212
16:12.680 --> 16:14.470
is completely different from

213
16:14.500 --> 16:15.960
what we heard in the south.

214
16:16.110 --> 16:17.040
It seems

215
16:17.510 --> 16:18.830
as long as we keep heading north,

216
16:18.830 --> 16:20.640
we will hear different tunes.

217
16:22.230 --> 16:22.960
However,

218
16:22.960 --> 16:23.830
if it weren't for our

219
16:23.830 --> 16:24.980
"Rules for the Hui Areas,"

220
16:24.980 --> 16:26.240
we wouldn't have heard

221
16:26.280 --> 16:27.610
such Hua'er folk songs.

222
16:27.870 --> 16:28.800
So,

223
16:28.910 --> 16:30.970
as long as we go north to resist Japan,

224
16:31.080 --> 16:33.400
observe mass discipline,

225
16:33.680 --> 16:35.210
and have the support of the people,

226
16:35.210 --> 16:37.940
we'll never lack new songs to listen to every day.

227
16:39.010 --> 16:40.130
What you just said

228
16:40.710 --> 16:41.870
is a riddle.

229
16:41.960 --> 16:43.560
Everyone, guess the answer.

230
16:43.900 --> 16:44.950
The answer?

231
16:44.970 --> 16:46.280
What's the answer?

232
16:47.040 --> 16:47.440
What's the answer?

233
16:47.440 --> 16:49.370
The answer is you, Luofu (Wentian),

234
16:49.370 --> 16:50.710
Comrade Wentian (literally "hear from heaven").

235
16:50.710 --> 16:52.430
This tune should only exist in heaven,

236
16:52.430 --> 16:54.840
but we can hear it every day on earth.

237
16:56.610 --> 16:57.920
Hear it every day...

238
17:45.650 --> 17:52.620
[Hadapu, Gansu]

239
17:45.790 --> 17:46.680
Come on in.

240
17:46.680 --> 17:47.960
Do you have any grain,

241
17:48.110 --> 17:48.990
any extra grain?

242
17:48.990 --> 17:49.880
Come in first.

243
17:49.880 --> 17:50.920
Stand still.

244
17:51.630 --> 17:53.110
I just want to ask you,

245
17:53.270 --> 17:54.230
are you

246
17:54.680 --> 17:56.960
really women?

247
17:57.160 --> 17:58.400
Are you really?

248
17:58.870 --> 18:01.610
[Cai Chang, wife of Li Fuchun]

249
17:59.230 --> 18:00.640
How could it be fake?

250
18:00.680 --> 18:02.710
Auntie, we are all women.

251
18:03.120 --> 18:04.720
Would you like to have a look?

252
18:05.070 --> 18:06.120
Have a look.

253
18:06.160 --> 18:06.840
Have a look.

254
18:08.030 --> 18:08.790
It's true.

255
18:09.030 --> 18:10.470
Look how thin they are.

256
18:11.840 --> 18:13.120
She has pierced ears.

257
18:12.580 --> 18:14.340
[Deng Yingchao, Committee Member of the Party General Branch of the Cadre Rest-and-Rehabilitation Company]

258
18:13.120 --> 18:14.030
-Yes, it's true. -Yes, it's true.

259
18:14.030 --> 18:15.230
But our army has discipline.

260
18:15.230 --> 18:17.030
We are not allowed to wear those.

261
18:17.550 --> 18:18.790
Your hair...

262
18:19.200 --> 18:21.070
Look, it's real.

263
18:21.400 --> 18:22.640
You don't have this?

264
18:22.640 --> 18:23.600
No, we don't.

265
18:23.790 --> 18:25.120
It's all like that, huh?

266
18:26.200 --> 18:27.030
Let me see your feet.

267
18:27.030 --> 18:28.690
Sis, we don't have bound feet.

268
18:29.710 --> 18:30.550
Not bound.

269
18:30.550 --> 18:31.400
Not bound.

270
18:31.600 --> 18:35.200
Did you volunteer to be soldiers?

271
18:35.470 --> 18:35.920
Of course.

272
18:35.920 --> 18:37.710
We all volunteered to join the army.

273
18:37.710 --> 18:38.750
You know,

274
18:38.990 --> 18:41.050
it's so hard for women to be soldiers.

275
18:41.180 --> 18:43.160
Besides, you are so young.

276
18:43.160 --> 18:44.440
Why did you go to be soldiers?

277
18:44.440 --> 18:45.680
What are you after?

278
18:45.750 --> 18:46.640
Sis,

279
18:46.780 --> 18:48.900
most of us are from poor families.

280
18:49.310 --> 18:50.630
Many of us were child brides,

281
18:50.630 --> 18:51.630
bullied since childhood.

282
18:51.440 --> 18:54.530
[Li Jianzhen, Political Instructor of the Cadre Rest-and-Rehabilitation Company]

283
18:51.990 --> 18:52.990
We joined the Red Army

284
18:52.990 --> 18:54.720
so that we won't be bullied anymore

285
18:54.720 --> 18:55.920
and can live a good life.

286
18:55.920 --> 18:57.030
We can also help those

287
18:57.030 --> 18:58.360
sisters who are just like us,

288
18:58.360 --> 18:59.710
so that they won't be bullied anymore

289
18:59.710 --> 19:00.790
and can live a good life.

290
19:00.790 --> 19:01.640
Auntie, Sis,

291
19:01.790 --> 19:03.120
we are here to buy grain.

292
19:03.160 --> 19:04.550
Do you have any extra grain

293
19:04.550 --> 19:05.280
to sell to us?

294
19:05.310 --> 19:06.310
We have cash.

295
19:06.710 --> 19:07.990
Let's not talk about the grain for now.

296
19:07.990 --> 19:09.400
Come sit on my kang and eat something first.

297
19:09.400 --> 19:10.440
Yes, exactly.

298
19:10.710 --> 19:12.470
No, we really can't.

299
19:12.790 --> 19:14.840
Auntie, we can eat,

300
19:15.030 --> 19:16.760
but you must accept this money.

301
19:17.020 --> 19:17.550
If you don't accept it,

302
19:17.550 --> 19:18.680
we absolutely cannot eat.

303
19:18.680 --> 19:19.810
We don't want money!

304
19:20.230 --> 19:21.070
Please accept it.

305
19:21.070 --> 19:21.990
You must accept it.

306
19:21.990 --> 19:23.360
Okay, I'll accept it.

307
19:23.390 --> 19:24.720
Come up and eat quickly.

308
19:25.120 --> 19:26.200
-Come on. -Exactly.

309
19:26.200 --> 19:28.230
Go up, get on the kang.

310
19:28.230 --> 19:28.750
Have a seat.

311
19:28.750 --> 19:29.270
Auntie,

312
19:29.270 --> 19:30.790
we are too dirty.

313
19:31.400 --> 19:32.640
We'll get your bed dirty.

314
19:32.640 --> 19:33.550
It's fine.

315
19:33.990 --> 19:35.390
We can just stand and eat.

316
19:35.640 --> 19:36.680
No, get up there.

317
19:36.920 --> 19:37.920
Okay, we'll dust ourselves off.

318
19:37.920 --> 19:39.030
We'll dust ourselves off.

319
19:39.030 --> 19:39.680
It's fine.

320
19:39.680 --> 19:40.920
Go get the steamed buns.

321
19:40.920 --> 19:41.510
Bring them here.

322
19:41.510 --> 19:42.310
Sit down.

323
19:42.960 --> 19:43.790
Get up there.

324
19:46.140 --> 19:47.260
[Liu Caixiang, Political Soldier of the Cadre Rest-and-Rehabilitation Company]

325
19:46.440 --> 19:47.510
This bed is warm.

326
19:47.570 --> 19:48.460
This is a kang.

327
19:48.960 --> 19:50.420
I heated it with firewood.

328
19:51.600 --> 19:52.880
Serve them some food.

329
19:52.910 --> 19:54.230
I'll do it.

330
19:54.790 --> 19:56.400
You're from the south, right?

331
19:56.400 --> 19:56.960
Yes, I am.

332
19:57.310 --> 19:58.160
This is a heated kang.

333
19:58.160 --> 19:58.710
Come on.

334
19:58.760 --> 19:59.870
Come on.

335
19:59.990 --> 20:01.320
Have some steamed buns.

336
20:01.510 --> 20:02.070
Hurry.

337
20:02.160 --> 20:02.680
Hurry.

338
20:02.680 --> 20:03.230
Thank you.

339
20:03.230 --> 20:04.290
Eat while it's hot.

340
20:05.170 --> 20:06.550
Come on. You eat too.

341
20:06.850 --> 20:07.890
Thank you.

342
20:10.800 --> 20:11.860
Thank you, Auntie.

343
20:12.020 --> 20:13.550
Eat more, eat more.

344
20:18.510 --> 20:20.910
Come, child. I'll serve you some porridge.

345
20:21.640 --> 20:22.470
Thank you, Auntie.

346
20:22.470 --> 20:23.200
Eat up.

347
20:23.640 --> 20:24.700
Thank you, Auntie.

348
20:25.270 --> 20:26.270
Eat.

349
20:27.200 --> 20:28.470
There's more.

350
20:29.760 --> 20:30.820
It's so delicious.

351
20:32.160 --> 20:34.220
Take your time eating. There's more.

352
20:37.470 --> 20:38.710
Take your time.

353
20:38.710 --> 20:39.680
Don't choke.

354
20:56.270 --> 20:57.270
It's delicious.

355
21:37.960 --> 21:41.070
Come on, everyone, have some chicken soup!

356
21:41.100 --> 21:44.030
Chicken soup with Angelica root is very nourishing.

357
21:44.140 --> 21:45.680
Yes, you've worked too hard.

358
21:45.680 --> 21:47.310
You need to nourish yourselves.

359
21:47.310 --> 21:48.230
Thank you both.

360
21:48.640 --> 21:51.470
We are in for a treat today.

361
21:51.500 --> 21:52.030
Thank you both.

362
21:52.030 --> 21:53.790
This is what we should do.

363
21:54.400 --> 21:58.320
The four elders have such deep feelings for the troops.

364
21:59.310 --> 21:59.880
Jiaxiang.

365
21:59.880 --> 22:00.270
Thank you, Mr. Lin.

366
22:00.270 --> 22:01.310
Come on.

367
22:01.560 --> 22:03.020
As the Minister of Supply,

368
22:03.020 --> 22:06.280
I finally live up to my name today.

369
22:07.230 --> 22:08.160
Comrade Zedong.

370
22:10.030 --> 22:13.750
Our situation is grim now.

371
22:14.640 --> 22:16.480
The general direction is undecided.

372
22:16.480 --> 22:19.290
Thousands of people must be fully prepared

373
22:20.200 --> 22:22.640
for a long-term future with no rear base

374
22:22.710 --> 22:24.310
to fight guerrilla warfare.

375
22:24.750 --> 22:26.550
The four elders are getting old.

376
22:26.600 --> 22:29.600
Now we have the conditions to transfer them.

377
22:30.310 --> 22:33.310
How about letting them work covertly in the areas under Nationalist control?

378
22:33.310 --> 22:35.110
The problem is how to bring it up.

379
22:35.120 --> 22:36.230
I'll find a way to tell them.

380
22:36.230 --> 22:38.630
Ensure every Company has three meals a day.

381
22:38.750 --> 22:40.750
Every meal must have vegetables and meat,

382
22:40.750 --> 22:42.310
barley and white flour.

383
22:42.340 --> 22:43.310
No problem.

384
22:43.310 --> 22:44.110
That's right.

385
22:44.120 --> 22:45.400
We've worked hard for so long.

386
22:45.400 --> 22:46.270
It's time to replenish our energy.

387
22:46.270 --> 22:46.710
Yes.

388
22:46.920 --> 22:47.600
I suggest

389
22:47.810 --> 22:49.870
we do what we did when entering Zunyi,

390
22:50.070 --> 22:52.360
giving every commander and fighter fifty cents

391
22:52.360 --> 22:54.630
to let them buy whatever they want.

392
22:55.030 --> 22:56.550
If we're going to give, let's give one yuan.

393
22:56.550 --> 22:57.120
Agreed.

394
22:57.230 --> 22:58.230
Agreed.

395
22:59.710 --> 23:01.070
Runzhi, come.

396
23:02.440 --> 23:03.070
Enlai.

397
23:03.550 --> 23:04.680
-Mr. Lin. -Sit down.

398
23:05.360 --> 23:06.270
Let me tell you,

399
23:06.300 --> 23:07.780
this place, Hadapu,

400
23:07.880 --> 23:10.360
is rich in traditional Chinese medicine and is the home of it.

401
23:08.990 --> 23:10.240
[Lin Boqu, Head of the General Supply Department of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission]

402
23:10.990 --> 23:12.640
I sent someone to the town

403
23:12.640 --> 23:14.750
to find the best doctor of traditional Chinese medicine

404
23:14.750 --> 23:16.400
to treat Enlai.

405
23:16.650 --> 23:18.360
Don't worry, you will get better.

406
23:18.360 --> 23:20.620
Drink some chicken soup to warm up first.

407
23:21.120 --> 23:21.880
Thank you, Mr. Lin.

408
23:21.880 --> 23:22.990
It's so delicious.

409
23:24.200 --> 23:26.360
Let's go see how the search for the doctor is going.

410
23:26.360 --> 23:27.510
Okay, let's go.

411
23:29.160 --> 23:30.280
Reporting, Chairman Mao!

412
23:30.280 --> 23:32.340
We found the water bottle you wanted!

413
23:32.470 --> 23:33.230
Kid.

414
23:34.020 --> 23:35.750
I didn't ask for a water bottle.

415
23:36.270 --> 23:38.370
Our Squad Leader said you were looking for food,

416
23:38.370 --> 23:40.940
and asked us to find a casserole and a water bottle.

417
23:40.940 --> 23:42.800
I'm in charge of the water bottle.

418
23:45.690 --> 23:47.350
You mean Water Margin, right?

419
23:48.370 --> 23:50.030
The 108 heroes of Liangshan Marsh.

420
23:50.030 --> 23:51.070
The rebellious Water Margin.

421
23:51.070 --> 23:52.200
Not water bottle.

422
23:53.900 --> 23:55.030
Casserole?

423
23:56.880 --> 23:59.020
You mean Romance of the Three Kingdoms, right?

424
23:59.020 --> 24:01.950
Does your Squad Leader have a heavier accent than me?

425
24:04.200 --> 24:05.190
Sorry, Chairman.

426
24:05.190 --> 24:06.190
Don't be sorry!

427
24:06.680 --> 24:08.140
A water bottle is good too.

428
24:08.400 --> 24:09.270
I'll accept it.

429
24:09.470 --> 24:11.470
Remember to return it to the fellow villager when we leave.

430
24:11.470 --> 24:12.220
Yes!

431
24:14.400 --> 24:15.440
Chairman Mao,

432
24:16.750 --> 24:18.470
we found the spiritual food you wanted.

433
24:18.470 --> 24:19.200
Good.

434
24:19.510 --> 24:20.070
Quick, put it here.

435
24:20.070 --> 24:20.590
These are what we found

436
24:20.590 --> 24:22.120
at the local postal agency.

437
24:22.380 --> 24:23.180
And this one

438
24:23.200 --> 24:25.800
was sent by Political Commissar Nie Rongzhen.

439
24:27.110 --> 24:28.870
[Liang Xingchu, Commander of the Reconnaissance Company directly under the Red 1st Army]

440
24:37.710 --> 24:39.510
Comrades, look at this news.

441
24:40.030 --> 24:42.200
Those entrenched in northern Shaanxi

442
24:42.470 --> 24:44.970
are the 26th Army of the Red Army.

443
24:44.990 --> 24:47.720
Commander Liu Zhidan commands three divisions,

444
24:48.200 --> 24:50.640
under which there are 14 guerrilla units.

445
24:50.920 --> 24:51.790
In addition,

446
24:52.120 --> 24:55.270
there are numerous groups and Red Guards.

447
24:56.360 --> 24:57.200
Luofu.

448
24:57.230 --> 24:59.270
I'm reading the same newspaper as you.

449
24:59.270 --> 25:00.200
It says here

450
25:00.230 --> 25:01.550
that the current situation in northern Shaanxi

451
25:01.550 --> 25:03.680
is similar to the situation in Jiangxi

452
25:03.880 --> 25:05.750
in the 20th year of the Republic of China (1931).

453
25:05.750 --> 25:06.600
Luofu.

454
25:06.750 --> 25:07.750
What date is this newspaper?

455
25:07.750 --> 25:09.120
This is August 1st.

456
25:09.310 --> 25:11.040
It's been less than two months.

457
25:14.270 --> 25:15.600
I have another one here.

458
25:16.230 --> 25:19.360
Xu Haidong's troops are advancing into northern Shaanxi,

459
25:19.360 --> 25:21.400
showing a trend of joining forces

460
25:21.960 --> 25:24.120
with Liu Zhidan's troops.

461
25:24.440 --> 25:27.300
This is the Jinyang Daily from the 3rd of this month.

462
25:28.540 --> 25:29.970
I have a copy here

463
25:30.290 --> 25:32.390
saying there is a Liu Zhidan in northern Shaanxi

464
25:32.390 --> 25:34.650
who has already occupied six county towns

465
25:34.650 --> 25:37.380
and is about to cross the Yellow River to the east.

466
25:39.150 --> 25:42.080
Luofu, the situation in northern Shaanxi is not bad.

467
25:47.790 --> 25:49.400
Comrades, look!

468
25:49.550 --> 25:50.880
What good stuff is this?

469
25:52.290 --> 25:52.980
Come.

470
25:54.960 --> 25:55.850
Come and see!

471
25:56.090 --> 25:56.840
What huge pancakes!

472
25:56.840 --> 25:58.230
These pancakes are so big,

473
25:58.230 --> 25:59.680
much bigger than the ones in Zunyi.

474
25:59.680 --> 26:00.160
Yes.

475
26:00.200 --> 26:01.770
These are not pancakes.

476
26:02.030 --> 26:03.440
It's called a Guokui flatbread.

477
26:03.440 --> 26:04.200
Guokui?

478
26:04.360 --> 26:05.230
Right.

479
26:08.710 --> 26:10.110
What are you waiting for?

480
26:10.470 --> 26:11.070
Let's eat!

481
26:11.200 --> 26:12.370
Yes, okay!

482
26:12.550 --> 26:13.750
Come, eat quickly.

483
26:14.160 --> 26:14.960
Eat quickly.

484
26:17.390 --> 26:19.390
Comrades, the mutton soup is ready!

485
26:20.230 --> 26:20.980
Come.

486
26:25.390 --> 26:27.720
Company Commander, it tastes so good.

487
26:30.250 --> 26:32.050
I didn't dote on you for nothing.

488
27:23.930 --> 27:24.860
Hello, leaders.

489
27:25.070 --> 27:26.130
Comrade Jia Tuofu.

490
27:26.790 --> 27:28.270
Let me introduce him to you all.

491
27:28.270 --> 27:30.310
This is Comrade Jia Tuofu from the White Areas Work Department

492
27:30.310 --> 27:32.430
of the Red Army's General Political Department.

493
27:32.240 --> 27:34.210
[Jia Tuofu, Director of the White Areas Work Department of the Red Army’s General Political Department]

494
27:32.430 --> 27:34.550
He once served as the Secretary-General of the Shaanxi Provincial Party Committee

495
27:34.550 --> 27:36.880
and is very familiar with the situation in northern Shaanxi.

496
27:36.880 --> 27:38.550
That's great.

497
27:38.710 --> 27:39.600
Comrade Jia Tuofu.

498
27:39.600 --> 27:40.030
Chairman.

499
27:40.030 --> 27:41.230
You can just introduce to us

500
27:41.230 --> 27:41.940
the situation in northern Shaanxi.

501
27:41.940 --> 27:42.990
-Have a seat. -Okay.

502
27:42.990 --> 27:43.400
Come.

503
27:45.920 --> 27:48.640
Facing the inquiries of several central leaders,

504
27:48.640 --> 27:50.360
Jia Tuofu described in detail

505
27:50.360 --> 27:52.070
the activities

506
27:52.210 --> 27:54.550
of the Shaanxi-Gansu Guerrilla Detachment (later the Red 26th Army)

507
27:54.550 --> 27:55.820
and the revolutionary struggle in Shaanxi

508
27:55.820 --> 27:58.360
before the Shaanxi Provincial Committee was destroyed

509
27:58.360 --> 28:01.070
in July 1933.

510
28:01.140 --> 28:02.960
He clarified that the northern Shaanxi region

511
28:02.960 --> 28:06.040
has a solid class foundation for revolution,

512
28:06.200 --> 28:07.830
good mass awareness,

513
28:07.950 --> 28:10.750
and sufficient strategic maneuvering space.

514
28:13.750 --> 28:14.450
Good.

515
28:15.270 --> 28:16.330
Comrade Jia Tuofu,

516
28:16.750 --> 28:18.220
the situation in northern Shaanxi you introduced to us

517
28:18.220 --> 28:19.280
is very important.

518
28:19.440 --> 28:21.120
-Good job. -Thank you, Chairman.

519
28:21.120 --> 28:23.050
Leaders, I'll take my leave first.

520
28:33.120 --> 28:34.050
Comrades,

521
28:34.400 --> 28:37.840
it looks like we need to revise the policy adopted at the E’jie Meeting—

522
28:37.840 --> 28:39.790
opening a route to the Soviet Union

523
28:40.160 --> 28:42.030
through Shaanxi and Gansu

524
28:42.840 --> 28:45.230
to the Inner Mongolia border.

525
28:45.920 --> 28:46.850
Comrade Zedong,

526
28:47.230 --> 28:50.600
do you want to clarify our next direction of action

527
28:51.230 --> 28:52.360
as northern Shaanxi?

528
28:52.360 --> 28:53.200
Yes.

529
28:53.530 --> 28:54.390
If there is a place

530
28:54.390 --> 28:56.250
where our Red Army can settle down

531
28:56.270 --> 28:57.470
and grow stronger,

532
28:57.600 --> 28:58.710
and geographically,

533
28:58.710 --> 29:00.880
it allows us to more quickly and directly

534
29:00.880 --> 29:03.070
advance to the anti-Japanese battlefield,

535
29:03.070 --> 29:04.550
why wouldn't we do it?

536
29:06.030 --> 29:07.790
The northern Shaanxi base area provides us

537
29:07.790 --> 29:08.790
with such conditions.

538
29:08.790 --> 29:10.750
Not only are there troops from northern Shaanxi there,

539
29:10.750 --> 29:12.160
but also those heading north like us,

540
29:12.160 --> 29:13.200
the 25th Red Army.

541
29:13.400 --> 29:14.990
When we get there and join forces with them,

542
29:14.990 --> 29:16.230
we can take root

543
29:16.710 --> 29:17.770
and grow stronger.

544
29:17.960 --> 29:19.900
Then the strategic goals we set before

545
29:19.900 --> 29:22.300
will have a great chance of being realized.

546
29:22.310 --> 29:23.640
Once we have a foothold,

547
29:23.990 --> 29:26.710
we can keep trying to persuade the Red Army that went south

548
29:26.710 --> 29:28.310
to turn back and march north.

549
29:28.440 --> 29:30.400
I agree with Comrade Zedong's opinion.

550
29:30.400 --> 29:31.360
Let's go to northern Shaanxi.

551
29:31.360 --> 29:32.590
I also agree to go to northern Shaanxi.

552
29:32.590 --> 29:33.050
Agreed!

553
29:33.080 --> 29:33.560
Agreed!

554
29:33.580 --> 29:34.430
Let's go to northern Shaanxi.

555
29:34.430 --> 29:34.990
Let's go to northern Shaanxi.

556
29:34.990 --> 29:35.710
Let's go to northern Shaanxi.

557
29:35.710 --> 29:36.510
Enlai.

558
29:37.340 --> 29:38.400
Finally found one,

559
29:38.700 --> 29:40.480
and he's the best traditional Chinese medicine doctor in town.

560
29:40.480 --> 29:41.070
Yes.

561
29:41.360 --> 29:42.490
After your meeting,

562
29:42.550 --> 29:44.550
Enlai, you can go and have a look.

563
29:44.750 --> 29:47.270
We didn't expect to find one so quickly.

564
29:47.550 --> 29:48.400
That's great.

565
29:48.430 --> 29:48.840
Yes.

566
29:49.070 --> 29:50.840
Mr. Lin, there's something even better.

567
29:50.840 --> 29:52.840
You four elders don't have to leave.

568
29:52.880 --> 29:53.950
You don't have to go.

569
29:53.950 --> 29:54.520
Go?

570
29:54.750 --> 29:54.990
Go?

571
29:55.020 --> 29:55.670
Where are we going?

572
29:55.670 --> 29:56.730
Where are we going?

573
29:57.310 --> 29:58.230
Nowhere.

574
29:58.570 --> 29:59.960
We are going to northern Shaanxi.

575
29:59.960 --> 30:01.380
Yes, to northern Shaanxi.

576
30:01.380 --> 30:01.990
To northern Shaanxi.

577
30:01.990 --> 30:03.050
Northern Shaanxi.

578
30:03.310 --> 30:04.750
Northern Shaanxi? Great.

579
30:04.750 --> 30:05.640
Okay.

580
30:05.990 --> 30:07.390
Wherever you go, we will follow.

581
30:07.390 --> 30:08.490
We will follow you.

582
30:12.360 --> 30:13.290
Feeling better?

583
30:13.450 --> 30:14.610
It hurts.

584
30:15.750 --> 30:16.400
It hurts.

585
30:17.880 --> 30:18.640
Get up quickly.

586
30:18.640 --> 30:19.440
Give me a hand.

587
30:22.310 --> 30:23.040
Still hurts?

588
30:23.270 --> 30:24.530
What are you all doing?

589
30:26.450 --> 30:27.710
Political Commissar.

590
30:28.620 --> 30:29.550
What's going on?

591
30:30.270 --> 30:31.030
Him,

592
30:31.790 --> 30:33.590
he ate two big Guokui flatbreads

593
30:33.790 --> 30:35.790
and drank four bowls of mutton soup.

594
30:37.070 --> 30:37.990
This child...

595
30:38.790 --> 30:39.680
Yun Guichuan.

596
30:40.120 --> 30:41.640
Stand up! Quick march!

597
30:42.250 --> 30:43.090
I can't move.

598
30:43.440 --> 30:44.230
Give me a hand. Come on.

599
30:44.230 --> 30:46.010
No, I can't move, Company Commander.

600
30:46.010 --> 30:47.710
Let me rest a bit. I'll run by myself.

601
30:47.710 --> 30:49.210
Stop resting. How long have you been resting?

602
30:49.210 --> 30:50.050
Hurry. Get up.

603
30:50.420 --> 30:51.740
It hurts.

604
30:52.050 --> 30:52.650
Let's go.

605
30:56.440 --> 30:56.950
What's wrong with you now?

606
30:56.950 --> 30:57.580
Slow down.

607
30:57.630 --> 30:58.960
I ate too much. It hurts.

608
30:59.510 --> 31:00.440
Yun Guichuan.

609
31:00.480 --> 31:02.000
This food is very precious.

610
31:02.000 --> 31:02.910
Don't waste it.

611
31:03.300 --> 31:05.210
You just ate too much.

612
31:06.010 --> 31:06.440
Liu Erzhu.

613
31:06.440 --> 31:07.840
Can't you save me some face?

614
31:07.840 --> 31:09.600
I'm a war hero after all.

615
31:09.750 --> 31:11.180
Everyone, stand up!

616
31:11.840 --> 31:12.600
Quick march!

617
31:13.200 --> 31:14.710
Let's go. I'll help you.

618
31:28.920 --> 31:30.640
Okay. The other one.

619
31:54.500 --> 31:55.630
Okay.

620
31:56.610 --> 31:58.300
Sir, how is he?

621
31:58.880 --> 32:02.650
This gentleman's pulse is wiry and slippery,

622
32:03.180 --> 32:05.390
weak and sinking.

623
32:05.930 --> 32:09.920
He must be suffering from liver disease.

624
32:10.590 --> 32:13.550
Coupled with acquired fatigue,

625
32:13.880 --> 32:15.630
insufficient rest,

626
32:16.030 --> 32:17.740
and a deficiency of both qi and blood.

627
32:17.740 --> 32:20.020
Sir, you are absolutely right.

628
32:20.790 --> 32:22.320
Is there any way to treat it?

629
32:23.470 --> 32:25.640
It's nothing serious.

630
32:26.230 --> 32:28.960
Just get the medicine according to the prescription,

631
32:28.960 --> 32:30.400
have him take a few doses,

632
32:31.510 --> 32:34.640
and rest well for a while, and he will be fine.

633
32:35.660 --> 32:38.460
I haven't asked for your name yet, sir.

634
32:40.360 --> 32:42.470
My name is Chang Tong.

635
32:44.030 --> 32:46.120
In this small town,

636
32:46.230 --> 32:49.750
I have been practicing medicine for decades.

637
32:50.270 --> 32:51.160
Mr. Chang.

638
32:51.750 --> 32:53.280
How much is the medical fee?

639
32:54.990 --> 32:57.550
The Red Army is an army of justice.

640
32:57.870 --> 33:00.660
It is fate that we met.

641
33:02.230 --> 33:05.080
The medical fee is waived.

642
33:06.710 --> 33:07.630
Mr. Chang,

643
33:08.600 --> 33:09.990
please wait.

644
33:10.660 --> 33:12.200
The Red Army has discipline.

645
33:12.200 --> 33:14.120
We must pay the medical fee.

646
33:14.300 --> 33:14.900
Yingchao.

647
33:16.550 --> 33:18.510
You don’t have to, really.

648
33:18.770 --> 33:19.920
Listen to me.

649
33:20.470 --> 33:22.280
I can't take your money.

650
33:22.730 --> 33:25.280
Many poor people in this town

651
33:25.550 --> 33:26.960
come to my clinic,

652
33:27.150 --> 33:28.880
and I don't charge them either.

653
33:28.960 --> 33:30.760
This has been the rule for years.

654
33:30.920 --> 33:31.980
It can't be broken.

655
33:32.550 --> 33:33.510
Sir.

656
33:34.310 --> 33:35.750
I won't break your rule.

657
33:37.710 --> 33:38.650
Wait a moment.

658
33:43.400 --> 33:44.470
How about this?

659
33:45.080 --> 33:47.800
This spoon has been with me for years.

660
33:47.830 --> 33:48.960
It's not worth much.

661
33:49.310 --> 33:51.840
I want to give it to you as a keepsake.

662
33:52.100 --> 33:53.420
Please accept it.

663
33:53.470 --> 33:54.150
This...

664
34:00.360 --> 34:02.840
Alright, I'll accept it.

665
34:04.960 --> 34:07.010
I wish you a speedy recovery.

666
34:07.030 --> 34:08.060
Thank you.

667
34:11.260 --> 34:13.590
Due to the Red Army's confidentiality system,

668
34:13.590 --> 34:14.550
Mr. Chang Tong

669
34:14.550 --> 34:16.840
did not know Zhou Enlai's true identity.

670
34:17.760 --> 34:19.800
He kept this copper spoon all along.

671
34:20.400 --> 34:22.580
Whenever he mentioned this to his descendants,

672
34:22.580 --> 34:25.540
he was full of praise for the Red Army's discipline.

673
34:26.159 --> 34:28.469
It was not until after the founding of the People's Republic of China,

674
34:28.469 --> 34:31.150
when staff members, based on the leaders' memories,

675
34:31.150 --> 34:33.550
came to Hadapu to trace the Long March,

676
34:34.070 --> 34:35.800
that the Chang family realized

677
34:35.989 --> 34:38.469
the Red Army leader Mr. Chang had treated

678
34:38.920 --> 34:41.080
was actually Premier Zhou Enlai.

679
34:43.800 --> 34:48.920
[Mount Emei, Sichuan]

680
34:46.210 --> 34:48.270
The oak stands proud.

681
34:49.610 --> 34:51.650
The sunshine spills.

682
34:52.090 --> 34:55.010
A world alive beyond my sill.

683
34:56.199 --> 34:57.760
The scenery of Mount Emei

684
34:57.800 --> 34:59.430
is different from Mount Lu.

685
34:59.880 --> 35:00.320
Yes.

686
35:00.360 --> 35:01.490
It has its own charm.

687
35:01.650 --> 35:03.810
[Soong Mei-ling, Wife of Chiang Kai-shek]

688
35:01.720 --> 35:04.550
Madam, it is said that during the Wei and Jin Dynasties,

689
35:04.550 --> 35:05.840
Monk Baozhang

690
35:05.860 --> 35:07.460
described Mount Emei as

691
35:07.960 --> 35:10.670
higher than the Five Great Mountains, the most beautiful in the world,

692
35:10.670 --> 35:12.730
and the number one mountain in China.

693
35:12.880 --> 35:14.080
Moreover, this place

694
35:14.400 --> 35:17.330
is known as the fairy mountain and Buddhist kingdom.

695
35:17.880 --> 35:19.840
It is said that living here for a long time

696
35:19.840 --> 35:21.590
not only allows you to enjoy the scenery,

697
35:21.590 --> 35:23.550
but also cultivates your mind and character.

698
35:23.550 --> 35:24.550
It's a pity.

699
35:24.670 --> 35:26.790
One may want peace, but circumstances won't allow it.

700
35:26.790 --> 35:28.000
We endured hardships,

701
35:28.000 --> 35:28.960
but failed to achieve full success.

702
35:28.960 --> 35:29.800
In the end, however,

703
35:29.800 --> 35:32.110
the Communist Army managed to break through Lazikou

704
35:32.110 --> 35:33.280
and reached Gannan.

705
35:33.670 --> 35:34.760
Gentlemen,

706
35:35.190 --> 35:36.920
didn't we agree

707
35:37.150 --> 35:39.500
that we are here to enjoy the scenery?

708
35:39.590 --> 35:41.880
Why say these things to ruin the mood?

709
35:42.190 --> 35:43.240
Madam is right!

710
35:43.670 --> 35:45.310
I was being presumptuous.

711
35:45.590 --> 35:46.650
Alright. Alright.

712
35:46.800 --> 35:47.630
I know.

713
35:47.670 --> 35:48.790
Even if you don't say it,

714
35:48.790 --> 35:50.760
you are thinking about these things.

715
35:50.760 --> 35:52.160
Take your time chatting.

716
35:53.870 --> 35:55.190
Walk faster.

717
35:56.000 --> 35:57.260
Zurong (Yan Daogang).

718
36:00.190 --> 36:01.120
Generalissimo.

719
36:01.190 --> 36:02.110
After going down the mountain,

720
36:02.110 --> 36:03.030
send an urgent telegram

721
36:03.030 --> 36:04.190
to Hanqing (Zhang Xueliang),

722
36:04.190 --> 36:06.020
asking him to come to Chengdu to see me immediately.

723
36:06.020 --> 36:06.580
Yes.

724
36:06.350 --> 36:10.310
[Yang Yongtai, Secretary-General of the Wuchang Field Headquarters]

725
36:06.800 --> 36:08.390
Generalissimo, you asked Hanqing to come...

726
36:08.390 --> 36:10.630
Hanqing has been the Director of the Wuchang Field Headquarters

727
36:10.630 --> 36:12.430
and has been idle for half a year.

728
36:12.590 --> 36:15.280
The Communist Army now has a strong tendency to continue north,

729
36:15.280 --> 36:17.840
and Hanqing's subordinates are all in the northwest.

730
36:17.840 --> 36:18.920
I plan to

731
36:19.110 --> 36:21.400
establish a Northwest Bandit Suppression Headquarters in Xi'an.

732
36:21.400 --> 36:23.330
I will be the Commander-in-Chief,

733
36:23.590 --> 36:24.840
and let him be the Deputy Commander-in-Chief,

734
36:24.840 --> 36:27.280
acting on behalf of the Commander-in-Chief.

735
36:27.280 --> 36:28.150
Understood.

736
36:28.470 --> 36:30.030
You are wise, Generalissimo.

737
36:30.030 --> 36:30.720
Brilliant.

738
36:30.750 --> 36:31.470
Let's go.

739
36:39.110 --> 36:40.490
Go away! Go away!

740
36:43.040 --> 36:45.560
Brother Chiang, look!

741
36:45.670 --> 36:46.960
It's bowing!

742
36:47.070 --> 36:48.360
It's worshipping you.

743
36:48.990 --> 36:50.430
Isn't it an auspicious sign?

744
36:50.430 --> 36:51.860
It's an auspicious sign.

745
36:52.240 --> 36:53.430
Good, good, good.

746
36:53.510 --> 36:54.470
Indeed.

747
36:54.640 --> 36:55.430
Generalissimo,

748
36:55.430 --> 36:57.680
even this monkey is respectful when it sees you.

749
36:57.680 --> 36:59.910
You are truly the chosen one.

750
37:00.080 --> 37:01.430
It just bowed.

751
37:02.240 --> 37:02.440
Yes.

752
37:02.440 --> 37:03.960
Then I will appoint it as

753
37:03.960 --> 37:05.630
the Monkey King of Mount Emei,

754
37:05.760 --> 37:07.470
to lead the monkey troops of Mount Emei.

755
37:07.470 --> 37:08.330
How about that?

756
37:11.620 --> 37:12.680
Let's go. Let's go.

757
37:24.320 --> 37:24.840
Come.

758
37:28.990 --> 37:31.450
Master, that monkey is really intelligent?

759
37:31.880 --> 37:33.850
The world is a field of merit,

760
37:34.240 --> 37:36.440
and karmic connections come together.

761
37:36.760 --> 37:38.470
What you can't calculate

762
37:38.820 --> 37:42.010
is not yours to get.

763
37:44.590 --> 37:47.030
On September 23, 1935,

764
37:47.670 --> 37:50.830
the CPC Central Committee decided to lead the Shaanxi and Gansu Detachment

765
37:50.830 --> 37:52.710
to continue north from Hadapu.

766
37:53.230 --> 37:54.800
The main force of the Red Army

767
37:54.800 --> 37:58.030
crossed the enemy blockade between Wushan and Zhangxian,

768
37:58.030 --> 37:59.760
and waded across the Wei River.

769
38:00.340 --> 38:04.340
On September 27, they arrived at Bangluo Town, Tongwei County.

770
38:04.990 --> 38:07.630
The meeting of the Standing Committee of the Politburo held that night

771
38:07.630 --> 38:09.360
formally passed a resolution,

772
38:09.920 --> 38:11.760
clearly designating Northern Shaanxi as

773
38:11.760 --> 38:13.700
the destination of the Red Army's Long March

774
38:13.700 --> 38:16.160
and the base camp of the Chinese revolution.

775
38:17.400 --> 38:18.960
Later history proved

776
38:19.440 --> 38:22.400
that this was an extremely wise strategic decision.

777
38:23.130 --> 38:24.530
The Bangluo Town Meeting

778
38:24.630 --> 38:26.900
also became an important meeting

779
38:27.140 --> 38:29.540
in the history of the Red Army's Long March.

780
38:31.190 --> 38:33.460
Since leaving the Central Soviet Area

781
38:31.340 --> 38:37.770
[Bangluo Town Primary School, Tongwei County, Gansu]

782
38:33.740 --> 38:35.320
and starting the Long March,

783
38:35.320 --> 38:38.110
we have chosen and searched for

784
38:38.110 --> 38:39.840
the final destination many times.

785
38:39.840 --> 38:42.280
For various reasons,

786
38:42.360 --> 38:44.960
we had to change our decisions multiple times.

787
38:45.430 --> 38:46.470
I hope this time,

788
38:46.590 --> 38:49.050
we can successfully reach Northern Shaanxi

789
38:49.190 --> 38:51.380
and finally gain a foothold.

790
38:53.740 --> 38:55.030
Good things take time.

791
38:56.000 --> 38:59.030
No matter how many twists and turns we've been through,

792
38:59.030 --> 39:02.590
our strategic principle of going north to resist Japanese aggression

793
39:02.590 --> 39:03.520
has not wavered.

794
39:03.710 --> 39:06.430
We are finally heading in the right direction.

795
39:09.030 --> 39:11.630
I've been thinking about something recently.

796
39:12.280 --> 39:13.800
Since we have made it clear

797
39:14.150 --> 39:15.670
that our next step is Northern Shaanxi,

798
39:15.670 --> 39:17.930
besides winning over the 4th Front Army,

799
39:17.990 --> 39:19.400
should we find a way

800
39:19.430 --> 39:21.230
to contact the 2nd and 6th Corps,

801
39:21.470 --> 39:23.590
inform them of our marching route,

802
39:23.720 --> 39:25.110
and let them go north at the right time

803
39:25.110 --> 39:27.760
to join us in Northern Shaanxi in the future?

804
39:27.960 --> 39:29.490
Enlai is absolutely right.

805
39:30.760 --> 39:32.430
We also saw in some newspapers

806
39:32.470 --> 39:35.550
that the 2nd and 6th Corps in the Hunan-Hubei-Sichuan-Guizhou area

807
39:35.550 --> 39:36.630
are also facing

808
39:36.720 --> 39:38.760
the heavy encirclement and suppression by Chiang Kai-shek.

809
39:38.760 --> 39:40.150
After we go north,

810
39:40.180 --> 39:42.110
their situation will become increasingly isolated.

811
39:42.110 --> 39:43.840
That won't work in the long run.

812
39:44.470 --> 39:45.860
The main problem now is

813
39:46.190 --> 39:48.160
that the telegraph code of our Red Army headquarters

814
39:48.160 --> 39:49.890
is in the hands of Zhang Guotao.

815
39:50.090 --> 39:51.670
We have no way to contact the 2nd and 6th Corps

816
39:51.670 --> 39:53.110
directly.

817
39:53.920 --> 39:55.150
Here is what I'm thinking.

818
39:55.150 --> 39:58.190
Send a plain code telegram to the 2nd and 6th Corps.

819
39:59.990 --> 40:00.830
Plain code?

820
40:01.920 --> 40:03.720
What if it's intercepted by Chiang Kai-shek?

821
40:03.720 --> 40:04.470
Right.

822
40:04.720 --> 40:05.590
If so,

823
40:05.590 --> 40:06.800
will it backfire?

824
40:06.920 --> 40:08.630
I know about

825
40:08.630 --> 40:10.470
Chiang Kai-shek's intelligence gathering capabilities.

826
40:10.470 --> 40:12.060
A single plain code telegram

827
40:12.060 --> 40:13.890
should not attract his attention.

828
40:13.890 --> 40:15.550
What I'm really worried about

829
40:16.240 --> 40:16.990
is that the 2nd and 6th Corps

830
40:16.990 --> 40:19.320
don't know the inside story of Zhang Guotao going south.

831
40:19.320 --> 40:21.630
If Zhang Guotao uses his code

832
40:21.720 --> 40:22.960
to impersonate the Central Committee,

833
40:22.960 --> 40:24.240
then the 2nd and 6th Corps

834
40:24.240 --> 40:27.970
will be in danger of being commanded by him without authorization.

835
40:29.450 --> 40:30.380
Well,

836
40:32.360 --> 40:34.020
I'm not that worried about it.

837
40:34.480 --> 40:36.140
Comrades Ren Bishi and He Long

838
40:36.400 --> 40:39.000
are both cadres with very strong Party spirit.

839
40:39.280 --> 40:40.880
Regarding the general policy of heading north to resist Japanese aggression

840
40:40.880 --> 40:42.320
proposed by the Central Committee earlier,

841
40:42.320 --> 40:43.280
they are well aware of it.

842
40:43.280 --> 40:44.990
If Zhang Guotao wants to act on his own will

843
40:44.990 --> 40:46.030
and make decisions for them,

844
40:46.030 --> 40:47.230
it won't be that easy.

845
40:49.070 --> 40:49.600
Okay.

846
40:49.640 --> 40:51.510
Then I will send a telegram in plain code

847
40:51.510 --> 40:52.920
to the 2nd and 6th Corps.

848
40:53.050 --> 40:54.650
Thank you for your hard work.

849
40:54.790 --> 40:55.860
Leaders,

850
40:56.190 --> 40:57.650
I have good news to report.

851
40:58.030 --> 40:59.550
Our Vanguard First Column of the First Detachment

852
40:59.550 --> 41:01.540
has already occupied Tongwei County.

853
41:01.540 --> 41:02.770
Were there any casualties in the battle?

854
41:02.770 --> 41:03.560
No.

855
41:03.880 --> 41:06.150
The enemy defending the city collapsed at the first blow

856
41:06.150 --> 41:07.330
and put up no resistance.

857
41:07.330 --> 41:08.810
Not only did we win without shedding blood,

858
41:08.710 --> 41:10.910
[Ye Jianying, Chief of Staff of the Shaanxi-Gansu Detachment and Commander of the Third Column]

859
41:08.920 --> 41:10.510
but we also captured a large amount of weapons and equipment,

860
41:10.510 --> 41:11.400
as well as supplies.

861
41:11.400 --> 41:12.150
Great.

862
41:13.520 --> 41:15.440
Chiang Kai-shek saw that we didn't have enough time

863
41:15.440 --> 41:17.200
to rest and reorganize in Hadapu,

864
41:17.200 --> 41:19.730
so he gave us a few more days in Tongwei County.

865
41:21.020 --> 41:23.000
Let's go to the First Column of the First Detachment now

866
41:23.000 --> 41:23.920
to express our regards,

867
41:23.920 --> 41:26.360
and get some free food from them along the way.

868
41:26.360 --> 41:27.020
Okay, okay!

869
41:27.840 --> 41:28.640
Give me a bowl.

870
41:28.990 --> 41:29.360
Here.

871
41:33.760 --> 41:34.620
I want some too.

872
41:37.030 --> 41:37.670
Sit.

873
41:39.010 --> 41:39.940
Comrades!

874
41:40.550 --> 41:42.240
The central leaders are here to visit us!

875
41:42.240 --> 41:43.110
Chairman.

876
41:43.720 --> 41:44.990
Hello, Chairman!

877
41:45.240 --> 41:46.510
Hello, Chairman.

878
41:51.890 --> 41:52.520
Comrades!

879
41:53.010 --> 41:54.300
Don't be so serious.

880
41:54.750 --> 41:56.550
We are not here to give a lecture.

881
41:57.070 --> 41:58.870
We are here to get some free food.

882
42:01.040 --> 42:04.480
Actually, I already ate at your detachment headquarters.

883
42:05.030 --> 42:06.260
Seeing everyone eating,

884
42:06.260 --> 42:07.720
I want to eat a little more.

885
42:07.720 --> 42:08.870
Do you agree?

886
42:08.990 --> 42:10.190
We agree!

887
42:10.190 --> 42:11.280
Okay, sit down!

888
42:11.800 --> 42:12.590
Please sit down, leaders.

889
42:12.590 --> 42:14.110
Okay, I'll sit here.

890
42:14.140 --> 42:14.760
Sit.

891
42:14.760 --> 42:16.360
Sit, sit down.

892
42:16.510 --> 42:17.630
Sit.

893
42:18.190 --> 42:18.840
You sit too.

894
42:18.840 --> 42:19.440
Okay.

895
42:21.030 --> 42:21.880
Comrades.

896
42:22.110 --> 42:23.880
I heard from Comrade Xiao Hua

897
42:24.030 --> 42:27.670
that the predecessor of this primary school was called Jinsheng (literally "close to the sage") Academy.

898
42:27.670 --> 42:28.470
I was thinking...

899
42:28.470 --> 42:28.930
Leader.

900
42:29.070 --> 42:31.760
Our Red Army fights for the poor

901
42:32.070 --> 42:33.550
and saves the poor masses.

902
42:33.920 --> 42:35.190
That makes us sages too.

903
42:35.190 --> 42:36.070
Today,

904
42:36.880 --> 42:40.470
we will get close to the sage here.

905
42:40.880 --> 42:41.810
Comrade Zedong.

906
42:41.960 --> 42:44.030
Didn't you say you came to express your regards,

907
42:44.030 --> 42:46.030
and get some free food along the way?

908
42:46.110 --> 42:48.280
The vanguard team won a great victory.

909
42:48.670 --> 42:50.630
We can't just get free food

910
42:50.630 --> 42:51.720
without expressing our regards, right?

911
42:51.720 --> 42:53.030
Yes, yes.

912
42:54.990 --> 42:57.960
Along the way of our Long March,

913
42:58.360 --> 43:00.190
I have composed a poem.

914
43:00.280 --> 43:02.800
Today, I will read it to everyone

915
43:03.150 --> 43:04.190
as a way to express our regards.

916
43:04.190 --> 43:05.030
Great!
